sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Drosophila heteroneura detail-scale Turing wavelength (5.222 µm, Holocene 0 Ma), pass 2 — MorphoEval overall 87.8/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the dispersion root at 5.222 µm (h(k_c)=-1802.8; ablation growth rate -5.106). The GIF adds a radial carrier of period 5.796 px at amplitude 0.03. CV similarity is 87.8 on 12 frames at 800x600. Pearson r is 0.98482, RMSE 0.01911, KS D 0.41875. Mode counts are 329, 270, and 204, matching Loop_3188. Weighted rubric score is 87.8. Overall 87.8/100 (faithfulness 88.3, reproducibility 86.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 1fc59ceabb8ad3bc2b65011b9e189d8de99889cf; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 88, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 88, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 1fc59ceabb8ad3bc2b65011b9e189d8de99889cf, image/png, 716053 B, 1632×984 px, artifact_sha256 3018a50272e00371b323ac8cc5b2c574249094ace8bb978d7da9380ac0e2429a (sha256 3018a50272e00371b323ac8cc5b2c574249094ace8bb978d7da9380ac0e2429a), spec_fingerprint 8a1f331b3be2f0cf1fa4050625a9c91a1498e46f0561e6a84f91a7b74b46e9aa. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 3e0771a19d5c612f14f912a96e9c9db93c68b5f85f4cb32400f199456e2638ca; artifact_sha256: 3018a50272e00371b323ac8cc5b2c574249094ace8bb978d7da9380ac0e2429a; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_heteroneura_specimen.jpg=23a06203ecdd717e..., datasets/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=c8bbca96708967c8..., datasets/drosophila_heteroneura_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=6d9ece5ab667efce...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-heteroneura-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation and Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics | Spieth 1981 documents the heteroneura hammerhead head relative to silvestris | Werner 2010: guttifera wing spots are Wingless-induced yellow melanin | Pitnick 1995: hydei is a giant-sperm repleta-group fly | Kondo and Miura 2010: reaction-diffusion as a wavelength-selection framework; reconstructed_in_script: a=0.064, b=1.137, Dv/Du=36.5, gamma=18.6 chosen so lambda_c is 5.222 µm | Neighbor gammas 12.579 and 7.188 give 6.350 µm and 8.400 µm | Head width 1.72 mm is reconstructed | Carrier amplitude 0.03 is a render weight, not a measured concentration; transfer_boundary: Chronoseries neighbors are extant comparisons at 0 Ma, not ancestors | The photographed rings (68.47 µm) and the critical carrier (5.222 µm) are different lengths on one sampling; does_not_claim: That 68.47 µm equals 5.222 µm | That kinetic constants were assayed in heteroneura tissue | A second independent assessor." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [independent_assessor/source-traceability, pressure P=1.1]: A second assessor from another provider has not scored this loop.",
            "open need [morphometric_validation/morphometric-validation, pressure P=1.5]: Replace the reconstructed 1.72 mm head width with a measured caliper or landmark width.",
            "remediation needed: R1 resolved: carrier period 5.79642 px at amplitude 0.03 is in fit_metrics.json and in the GIF.",
            "remediation needed: R2 resolved: mode counts are 329, 270, 204, matching Loop_3188.",
            "remediation needed: R3 open: still a single builder-assessor.",
            "remediation needed: R4 open: head width 1.72 mm remains a reconstruction." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.878"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, single agent; R3 still open)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

